OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe evening
OL,6,Fwill be mostly dry with only a very
OL,7,Fsmall chance of the odd light shower
OL,8,Fat first. The night will then stay dry
OL,9,Fwith clear periods, turning quite
OL,10,Fchilly in sheltered glens.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FDry with bright or sunny
OL,13,Fspells in the morning. The afternoon
OL,14,Fwill stay dry but sunshine turning
OL,15,Fmore hazy as cloud spreads east.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
